  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Cooperation Statistics 2024-2027 - Institutional Cooperation Statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Myndighetssamarbete statistik 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is enhanced capacity to produce statistics in line with user needs and EU requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka statistikmyndighetens kapacitet att producera statistik av god kvalitet, samt att bidra till &#xf6;kad tillg&#xe4;nglighet i linje med anv&#xe4;ndarnas behov, samt att att bidra till anpassning till EU:s standarder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve SSO&#x2019;s overall capacity to produce and disseminate quality statistics, to provide an increased availability of statistics in accordance with the needs of current and future users, as well as the requirements of the EU acquis in statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
